{"3704770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Die Robot", "steam_appid": 3704770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704770/extras/2e8382e00e3446fd890627422790855b.webp?t=1781310707\" width=617 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the waves. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Die Robot</i></strong> is a fast-paced <strong>third-person tower defense game</strong> where you, <strong>Kip</strong>, an untested  robot, must build, battle, and outlast waves of increasingly intelligent &amp; destructive enemies. Guided by the quirky and mysterious AI, <strong>M011Y</strong>, you’ll defend the evacuated lab of tech-titan Dr. Cyrus Vexler from invading robots with traps, tech, and brutal melee combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everything is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704770/extras/1e9d1446b2b9d92d72df3ba8638eb04b.webp?t=1781310707\" width=605 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place traps and create deadly mazes to funnel enemies into your kill zones. Every decision matters—your base is your first and last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704770/extras/864a4a65b4d77848f27035d7ba2dd3c9.webp?t=1781310707\" width=605 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between powerful melee attacks and high-tech abilities. Charge up energy to unleash devastating combos or knock enemies back when you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 